  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/70f8853f-3bd4-4361-be42-7e7ed394782e-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 51px;\" /></p><p>If after division, one of the charge is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;the other charge will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. The force between them can be written as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>For the force between them to be maximum,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>K</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;C</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
